    <h1>Short Sale: A Calm, Plain-English Guide for North DFW Homeowners</h1>
    <p>If you are reading this, there is a good chance your home is worth less than what you owe on it, or your monthly payment has become harder to carry than it used to be. Maybe a job changed, a family situation shifted, a medical bill arrived, or you need to move and the numbers simply do not work. That is a stressful place to be, and it is more common than most people talk about.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
